\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces CellQLearn-v2 per-junction state space $\mathcal  {S}_i$ (Eq.~\eqref  {eq:cq2_state}), and how it propagates along the corridor. (1) Each junction sits on the bus route with upstream and downstream neighbours. (2) Downstream saturations are reported back and the worst wins: $\sigma ^{\text  {ngh}}_i=\max _{j\in \mathcal  {N}(i)}\sigma ^{\text  {down}}_j$, so a platoon is never pushed into a neighbour that will spill it back; $g^{\text  {ngh}}_i$ flags an open downstream green-wave window. (3) The action's released platoon propagates forward hop by hop, with the cascade cost of Eq.~\eqref  {eq:ctm_cascade} charged per hop. The same neighbour-max rule runs at every junction, so the coordination tiles corridor-wide: each junction reads its neighbours' state and prices its own release into theirs.}}{66}{figure.caption.145}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cq2_state}{{10}{66}{CellQLearn-v2 per-junction state space $\Scal _i$ (Eq.~\eqref {eq:cq2_state}), and how it propagates along the corridor. (1) Each junction sits on the bus route with upstream and downstream neighbours. (2) Downstream saturations are reported back and the worst wins: $\sigma ^{\text {ngh}}_i=\max _{j\in \Ncal (i)}\sigma ^{\text {down}}_j$, so a platoon is never pushed into a neighbour that will spill it back; $g^{\text {ngh}}_i$ flags an open downstream green-wave window. (3) The action's released platoon propagates forward hop by hop, with the cascade cost of Eq.~\eqref {eq:ctm_cascade} charged per hop. The same neighbour-max rule runs at every junction, so the coordination tiles corridor-wide: each junction reads its neighbours' state and prices its own release into theirs}{figure.caption.145}{}}
\newlabel{fig:cq2_state@cref}{{[figure][10][]10}{[1][66][]66}}
